                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Abramu naakajisi myaka iili makumi aali musanu aane amusanu aine, Jehova wakalibonya kuli-Abramu, wati, Ndime Leza Singuzuzyoo­ nse, Enda kunembo lyangu cakululama. ",
          "type": "text",
