        {
          "text": "Alimwi njookupa, webo alunyungu lwako luciza, nyika yabutuntulisi bwako, nkokuti nyika yoonse ya-Kanana, mwiivube lyoonse, nkabela njooba Leza wabo.",
          "type": "text",
