            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.7.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joh 7:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana mulombe uuli amazuba aali musanu aatatu uleelede kupalulwa. Baalumi boonse mumazyalani aanu oonse baleelede kucitilwa obo, nibaba bazyedwe mumaanda aanu nibaba baulidwe amali kubeenzu batali balunyungu lwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo uuzyedwe muŋanda yako ayooyo uulidwe amali aako, boonse buyo baleelede kupalulwa. Aboobo cizuminano cangu cili munyama yanu ciyooba cizuminano citamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:14"
