        {
          "text": "Alimwi Leza wakaambila Abrahamu kuti, Alakwe Sarai mukaako, izina lyakwe talikooyooambwa limbi kuti ngu-Sarai, pe, izina lyakwe liyooba Sara. Nkabela njoomupa coolwe, njookupa mwana mulombe mulinguwe. ",
