        {
          "text": "Mpoonya awo Abrahamu wakabweza Ismayeli mwanaakwe aboonse ibakazyalwa muŋanda yakwe aboonse mbaakaulide amali aakwe, baalumi boonse bamuŋanda ya-Abrahamu, wapalula lukanda lwandomo zyabo mubuzuba obo mbubonya, mbuli Leza mbwaakamulailila. ",
